    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38799" root="مقط" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاقِطٌ</span></b>  The <i>freedman of a freedman:</i> (K:) or
the <i>slave of a slave of a freedman:</i> whence the
Arabs say, in reviling, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ سَاقِطُ بْنُ مَاقِطِ بْنِ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاقِطٍ</span>. (S.) See art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سقط</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَّاطٌ</span> [which
is its pl.] like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُقَّاطٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُقَّاطٌ</span>, signifies, accord.
to IAar, The <i>refuse,</i> or <i>lowest</i> or <i>basest</i> or
<i>meanest sort,</i> or mankind, or of people. (TA
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خشر</span>.)

